<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Easy inspect spam melee</Major>
    <Description>Hello , added my own spin on a inspect spam macro i saw , by playing around with the delay and adding a small loop. Use:
Map this to a button like F and have it refference another bind like N where your in-game bind for inspecting a weapon is. So you can use F for inspect spamming and N for actual inspect animations.

Nice with heirlooms like raptor claw and wraith's kunai , because pressing it once spins it 5 times but with a small delay so that if you have to swap back to your weapon you arent stuck spamming inspect.

The delay times that work for me are : 
Wraith's kunai 130ms
Raptor claw 100ms
(Can't test other heirlooms since i don't own them)

Default is 130 so that you can use it with both although i would suggest trying 100ms if you are gonna be using it with the raptor claw. 

Cycle by default is 5 , again , feel free to play around and see what works for you but 5 for me is a good midle ground. </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 17 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 17 1
Delay 120 ms
GoWhile 1 5</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>